Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have traveled\Ndifferent paths, we are best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only\Ncompass that's pointing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,us along the many roads\Nthat come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon,\Nwe'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the whistle is reading\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's stay with us done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one of no hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel\Nfarther than we've ever gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And then tomorrow we\Nwill find suspense And
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,then commence to live out\Nanother day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams. And you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop\Nit We will be one, go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies and gents But the\Nother competitors are flying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all over the place What's\Ncausing such a phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kelly Funk is punching\Nthem into a malignion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I saw, but I can't\Nmake heads or tails of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Bobby and Kelly become\None and the same somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jacket, jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Two in a coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobby's been strong as hell\Nsince the day he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But all that muscle's\Nwasted on a softie like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where my power comes in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When he wears me as his skin,\NI can take over his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I bust out my\Nfighting skills and use his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,brute strength in ways he\Ndon't have the guts to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy who ate the\Njacket jacket fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me take control\Nof any man or any beast
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that puts me on and\Nwears me like a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And since Bobby's wearing me,\Nwe're just like the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He really made quick work of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you must be the other\Nbrother from the Kano kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, pal, your little bro\Nhere didn't put up much of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobby and I make a pretty good\Nliving working together as assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, what a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even protect each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat him, because\Nhe didn't train enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this supposed to be the\Ngreat Kano Kingdom martial art?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh! No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up any emotional\Nattachment to my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the moment I became a student\Nof the Aiden Pack Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon my honor as the 13th leader\Nof the proud Haposui army,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I will avenge\Nmy fallen subordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That. Was. Such. A. Thrill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The eight impact fist claims its victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see why size the G and just when it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,looked like no one would\Nbeat that monster Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want my helmet back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Charitable donations!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made me quite a wealthy man\Nover the past two years, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made a fortune nabbing all the\Nprisoners you set free from Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not giving up till\NI've got the rest of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The genius jester, Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,First son of the sea, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The miracle maker, Ivankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiryu of the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a hero for\Nhunting all of you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I wonder how\Nthose guys are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There are even more escapees from level 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ones the public doesn't even know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,From level 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, and I know just where to find them\NGuess some of the others made it out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out of the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean the Bandit has just been\Ndefeated with a single blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to be on the receiving end of a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,headbutt from the legendary\Npirate Don Chinchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,two other tough competitors have been\Nlocked in their own deadly battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an excellent matchup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a life or death struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Between two of the fiercest fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ever to grace this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They blow down every competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That stood in their way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,all in preparation for this struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the true test of their skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls go wild with excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone in the coliseum's got\Ntheir eyes glued to this one fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nowhere left to run—you will\Nanswer for what your grandfather did,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll make certain of that,\Nthanks to that bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i lost my entire fortune and\Neverything that i once held dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,my power, even my most precious\Nmemories from the years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,of my youth—I told you to take\Nit up with my grandpa, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,death is much too lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a punishment for all the\Nsuffering garb has made me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,endure—I'll show him what\Nit means to live with loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a fate worse than\Ndeath. now surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this thing, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and to do that, i have\Nto get through this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm getting my revenge right\Nhere and now—out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,move aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a clash of conquerors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,hockey—this is what it\Nmeans to be a true king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to be a true king
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Boa Hancock,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is down to two competitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The arena has been\Ncompletely littered with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the unconscious bodies\Nof once mighty warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all thanks to the clashing wills\Nof these final two fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But it begs the question,\Nwhat did we just witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you wield the\NConqueror's Haki as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what sort of king could\Nyou ever hope to be, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know there are countless souls\Nin the new world who can wield such power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to determine who deserves\Nthe title is a battle amongst you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the end of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd find the strongest warrior\Namongst a legion of conquerors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then could one be\Ncalled King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me before I kill\Nyou, who taught you Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How irksome?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of dredging up the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my treasure, Scrawl-Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I may gaze upon its splendor,\Nbut it lies forever waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,just beyond my reach, so close\Nyet so far, a living hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears this legendary pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is calling his eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai, I thought the plan was\Nfor you to win the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't worthy enough\Nto move to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But trust me, once Grandpa gets\Ngoing, no one can stand in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They called me Chinjow\Nthe Drill because at one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,time my head possessed\Nan extraordinary shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,do you have any clue what pain Garp\Ninflicted on me for the millionth time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out, Lucy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,now's your chance, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's, sir, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't that boy ever seem to\Nkeep his nose out of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sanji, I say—we\Ngo to the Toy House,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,rescue Congeno, and deal\Nwith this situation later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to help you with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid it's gonna\Nhave to wait—tons of marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're trying to surround\Nthe coliseum—so many to what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like there's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,an issue of pirates and criminals\Nopenly competing in the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's gonna scoop them up\Nas soon as they leave the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a society
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,can only properly operate if\Ncriminals are apprehended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you're working with pirates and\None of them is standing right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,here oh yes Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find some way to warn\NLuffy about the situation out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But the entrance gate is so heavily\Nguarded, there's no way we can get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me not a single contestant\Nhas left the Coliseum? No, sir. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I find that hard to believe, since there\Nwere hundreds of losers from Block A and B.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They should have already\Npoured out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Maynard went\Nundercover as a competitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but we haven't been able to contact him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He just had to charge in on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A rookie mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on inside, it's got\Nthe stench of corruption all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two special\Nlaws here in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules that have been strictly observed\Nsince Doflamingo's reign began a decade ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First, there's a kingdom-wide\Ncurfew at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No citizen is allowed\Noutside after 12. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even grown-ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans have to return to their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And toys back to the house of toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed outside late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even to go out and buy a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's closed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Second rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toys must not enter human houses, and\Nhumans are to never enter a toy house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone's\Nfriendly with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't get why\Nthere's a law against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess there's gotta be some kind\Nof distinction between people and toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Though anywhere else, I\Nwould go without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only been here a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but really, I've gotten\Nused to things here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of toys are you guys, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have free will and can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, whoever created you all would\Nhave to be some sort of genius like Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegabuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Esther, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got human on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy's broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize my voice, Esther?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you remember who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away, you disgusting little creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never acted like this around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember me, Esther!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from her, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My Esther!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you forget your\Nboyfriend so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, you don't hook\Nup with that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, you fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a ride, Onepoco! Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way too heavy for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a word with him. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,about him he's a toy just like us well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,tell him who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you are I'm the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,father of that boy over there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman with him is my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Milo, not one Poco.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Young man, is your father around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I never had one, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask if you have a husband? I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I never married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, is that so unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you trying to prove\Nto me back there with the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This kingdom's divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A country filled with the forgotten,\Nand those who forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every toy you see was\Nat one point a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone came to our island ten\Nyears ago, courtesy of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They turned us into toys\Nwith their Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, if you're a toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that means look—we're\Napproaching flower field!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything once we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,mercy for the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be quicker if I wasn't a thun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thun. What are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you waiting for, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You were attacked, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless, Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need tension rods to keep all\Nthe shelves from falling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Leo, you should get going soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need a lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Grandma, but I'm sure there'll\Nbe something to eat over at headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sew everything\Nthat might fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Safety's been restored!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, that Usalund sure\Nis something, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So much power, he can shake the entire\Nkingdom only using that strange old Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Usalund's a hero\Nstraight out of the legends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, Leo, I know I look\Nold, but I'm not going to topple over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Tomtada Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of relationship\Ndo you think these
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,guys have with the\Nwarlord Doflamingo anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue, but I know they're\Ndead serious about fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Usalind and Robbalind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you two gotten enough to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I totally pigged out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that is, I am full\Nand ready for action!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,See, what did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's trembling\Nwith so much excitement,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it's making the Earth shake all around us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How awesome is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His power is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One question, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people keep mentioning some final\Nbattle involving yours truly. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,what reason do you want\Nto fight Doflamingo? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just a hero, but a comedian, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we want to rescue\N500 of our closest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Over in the secret factory in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,where they're being enslaved, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say a factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the one Luffy and\Nthe others want to destroy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The same one that's producing Smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they're being\Nforced to manufacture there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but they've imprisoned\Nan important tentata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Our obnoxious, selfish,\Nfickle, despicable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,mean-spirited Princess Monchery\Nis being held inside that plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've got to hurry. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you describe her\Nmakes her sound kind of awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's still one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And Nolan himself would rescue anyone\Nwho needed saving, wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:20:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's totally what a real hero would do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I am his descendant, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for our legendary hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo! Flopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the Don Quixote\Nfamily is leaving the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably beneath the Coliseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yellow Cobbis and Beyond's pink\Nbees are ready to fly any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out, Usaland and Roboland! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the rest of you Tontadas ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fight is in Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath the Coliseum, inside the Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
